Package: beszelmonitor
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd
Conflicts: beszel-agent
Replaces: beszel-agent
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/henrygd/beszel
Description: Lightweight server monitoring hub with agent
 Beszel is a lightweight server monitoring platform with historical
 data, Docker container stats, and alerts. This package bundles both
 the hub (web dashboard) and the agent as static Go binaries built
 from the official upstream source, so your NAS monitors itself out
 of the box.
 .
 The web UI opens in a new browser tab via the TOS App Center route
 /beszelmonitor/. The backend listens on loopback only; no external
 port is exposed. First visit walks you through creating the admin
 account. Data is stored in /var/lib/beszelmonitor.
 .
 Upstream author: henrygd (https://github.com/henrygd/beszel)
 Packaged for TOS by Moechz.
